["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">郷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>故乡；村庄；家乡；地区</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ・ゴウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">故郷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">故乡；出生地；老家</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郷愁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">乡愁；思乡</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郷里</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">故乡；出生地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">揺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>摇动；摇晃；震动；摇摆；晃动</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゆ.れる・ゆ.る・ゆ.らぐ・ゆ.るぐ・ゆ.する・ゆ.さぶる・ゆ.すぶる・うご.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">揺れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摇晃；摇摆；摇动；颤动；抖动；颠簸；摇曳；闪烁；动摇；不稳定；不安定；摇摆不定；犹豫</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">動揺</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どうよう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摇晃；颤动；摇摆；振荡；骚动；不安；激动；混乱；心神不宁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">揺らぐ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆらぐ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摇晃；摇摆；震动；颤动；摇晃不定；动摇；变得不稳定</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">既</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>以前；已经；早已</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すで.に</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">既に</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すでに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">已经；先前；以前；无可否认地；确实地；首先</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">既婚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きこん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">已婚；已婚的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">薦</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>推荐；劝告；鼓励；提供；垫子</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すす.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">推薦</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すいせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">推荐；推举；介绍</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">隣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>相邻；邻居；邻近</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とな.る・となり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">隣</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">となり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邻近；相邻；隔壁；隔壁房屋；邻居；隔壁邻居</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">華</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>华丽；花；中国；光彩</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ・ケ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はな</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">豪華</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ごうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奢华；豪华；华丽；富丽堂皇；宏伟；壮丽；精致；炫目</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">華奢</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かしゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">奢华；豪华；炫耀；艳丽</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">華美</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かび</span><span class=\"k-wz\">华丽；富丽；堂皇；壮观；艳丽；浮华；奢侈；奢华</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">範</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>模范；范例；模型</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">範囲</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">范围；范畴；领域；幅度</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">規範</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">模式；标准；规范；准则；范例</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">模範</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">范例；楷模；榜样；典范</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">隠</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>隐藏；遮盖；隐蔽</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">イン・オン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かく.す・かく.し・かく.れる・よ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">隠す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かくす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">隐藏；隐瞒；遮掩</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">隠れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かくれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">隐藏；隐蔽；躲藏；消失（于……之后）；被遮挡；被遮住；从视野中消失；隐居；遁世；不为人知；未被发现；隐而不显；薨逝；去世（用于身份高贵者）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">隠居</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いんきょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">退休；退休后隐居的生活；退休者；隐居者；（二战前）让出家主之位</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">徳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>品德；恩惠；利益</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">トク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">道徳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">どうとく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">道德；道德观念</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">哲</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>哲学；明晰</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さとい・あきらか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">哲学</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てつがく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">哲学</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">杉</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>杉树；柳杉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すぎ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">杉</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">日本杉（Cryptomeria japonica）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">里</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>村庄；故乡；娘家；旧制里程单位</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郷里</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">故乡；出生地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">釈</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>解释；释放；说明</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シャク・セキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とく・す.てる・ゆる.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">解釈</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいしゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">解释；说明；理解；诠释</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">己</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>自己；自我</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ・キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">おのれ・つちのと・な</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自己</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自己；自身</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">威</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data